cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "geoarg: a deterministic argument auditor for geological claims"
abstract: "geoarg compiles a geological argument into a structured contract, judges it with deterministic rules, grounds transcription quotes against the source document, and binds deliverables and ledger checkpoints so the reasoning can be handed off and re-checked."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "GeoArg contributors"
version: "1.12.2"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
license: MIT
